## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Quest Log
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.2.0
## Notes: The campaign ledger — one double-wide window over the whole quest log: every quest listed down the left under its zone, searchable and sortable and filterable, with the full briefing on the right — objectives with their progress, the description, every reward with its tooltip — and Track, Share, Announce and Abandon on the same screen. It replaces the stock quest log rather than sitting beside it.
